Package: crowd.forecast.evaluation
Title: Scoring and Aggregating Probabilistic Forecasts on Public Corpora
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alejandro", "Guerrero Padrés", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "alejandro.g.padres@gmail.com")
Description: Analysis project. Builds a reproducible data layer over the Good
    Judgment Project ACE tournament surveys and ForecastBench's 2024 human
    round, then evaluates calibration and forecast-aggregation methods out of
    sample. Not a package; DESCRIPTION records dependencies for renv.
